WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
Two students draw the same graph.

2
00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.700
Same curves. Same shift.

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.760
Same answer underneath.

4
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.870
One gets full credit for it.

5
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.310
The other can lose every mark
the graph could have earned.

6
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.420
From a distance, you
could not tell them apart.

7
00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:18.260
So what separates a graph
that earns full marks

8
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:21.220
from one that looks
right but scores nothing?

9
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.740
In this mission, you'll
build a demand and supply

10
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.230
graph step by step, after
a new technology cuts

11
00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:29.060
the cost of solar panels.

12
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.720
Then you'll find the
price a monopoly charges,

13
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:34.550
and the trap that catches many students.

14
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.690
Your mission: find out exactly
what earns credit on a graph.
